{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/b_zNNZTeip-jJsIapzK8jA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:44.329913+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/b_zNNZTeip-jJsIapzK8jA","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTPOtsRRib8ia8tE2KYoX7xFCAu4Zn0wzNZ3iaSpOnndtRRClsk4LT1yCBg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>学院概况</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTnpDIPoDfJaArpmQXdM2sut2Vy9YXhkTxytNFJYjxr1YheiaSFMvS4gQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>南京理工大学自动化学院是在原中国人民解放军哈尔滨军事工程学院（哈军工）炮兵工程系指挥仪专业和火炮系随动系统专业基础上，经过了不断改造和调整，于1985年正式成立了华东工学院自动控制系，1996年改名为南京理工大学自动化系，2005年更名为南京理工大学自动化学院。</span></p><p><span>学院拥有“控制科学与工程”、“电气工程”、“智能科学与技术”3个一级学科。拥有国家级虚拟仿真实验教学中心、“自主智能无人系统信息感知与协同控制”部级国际科技合作基地、“交通信息融合与系统控制”工业和信息化部重点实验室、江苏省实验教学示范中心、工业与信息化部实验教学示范中心以及“多运动体信息感知与协同控制”江苏省重点实验室、“复杂运动体智能导航与控制”江苏省工程研究中心等高端教学科研公共平台。</span></p><p><span>学院现有教职工182人，其中两院院士2人、国家级教学名师2人、国家级领军人才7人、国家级青年人才10人、“全国创新争先奖”获得者1人、“国家百千万人才工程”获评者2人。拥有全国高校黄大年式教师团队1个，教育部创新团队1个、江苏省青蓝工程科技创新团队1个、江苏省“六大人才高峰”创新人才团队1个，教育部创新团队1个，教育部虚拟教研室建设试点1个，江苏省创新团队2个。学院在校本科生1584人，硕士研究生1697人，博士研究生276人。研究生年度就业率100%。</span></p><p><span> “十三五”以来，获国家科技进步一等奖、国家技术发明二等奖、国家自然科学二等奖等省部级及以上科技荣誉和奖励近20项，承担了国家自然科学基金创新研究群体、国家重大仪器专项、中央军委科技委基础加强计划项目等一大批国家级重大项目。每年发表高水平期刊论文100余篇，徐胜元教授连续十一年入选爱思唯尔（Elsevier）中国高被引学者。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开放日</span></strong><strong><span>基本信息</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTnpDIPoDfJaArpmQXdM2sut2Vy9YXhkTxytNFJYjxr1YheiaSFMvS4gQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>参营人数300人左右</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线上</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>现在-2025年7月30日截止</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国高校在校生（2026年应届毕业生），且学习成绩优异、英语水平良好（四六级成绩或其他资格考试证明）；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人本科专业为自动化、电气及相近专业，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研工作能力；</span></p><p><span>（4）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/，点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，学院根据学科特点、开放日规模，选择一定数量学生参加开放日活动，并通过学院网站进行通知。</span></p><p><span>报名截止日期为：2025年7月30日。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>由各单位根据实际情况指定（可包括申请表、个人陈述、本科阶段成绩、英语水平证明及其他证明材料等），扫描为一个pdf，发至联系邮箱yz110@njust.edu.cn。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>活动内容：学院情况介绍、研究生教育及就业情况介绍、学科团队研究方向介绍等；</span></p><p><span>具体安排：</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeT3KicoicQD0UAflkpjZ62EcrtRBeZqJXKPtDFf316fibeSwwr8gurDuTKA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>联系人：彭老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：025-84318726</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：yz110@njust.edu.cn</span></p><p><span><strong><span>报名人员加群（qq）：742221301</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsZG7DEDeiaCLs5aRkXYUeTRDfumm6bDutt11SIDicIibsrzEj3aBpia0dEGf2DtP2g1KK3PDJmyVuGg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>出品 | 南京理工大学研招办</span></p><p><span>来源 | 自动化学院</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 代芳冰</span></p><p><span>初审 | 秦俊华 自动化学院</span></p><p><span>审核 | 齐玉辉</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"bd3dd344aeb9e7d1aa97384d3d3e37c3c2ca64b96bc611b7934366dd26a00e4a"